@baseUrl = http://localhost:5256

# Anonymous endpoint: no sign-in needed. The url parameter must be URL-encoded.
# Replace @thumb with a thumbnailUrl from GET /works if this one stops working.
@thumb = https%3A%2F%2Fi.pximg.net%2Fc%2F540x540_70%2Fimg-master%2Fimg%2F2026%2F05%2F06%2F11%2F56%2F24%2F144433235_p0_master1200.jpg

### ============================================================
### GetImage — allowed
### ============================================================

### Real Pixiv thumbnail — expect 200, image/jpeg, Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, immutable
GET {{baseUrl}}/images?url={{thumb}}

### Allowed host, missing file — expect 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/images?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.pximg.net%2Fimg-master%2Fimg%2F2026%2F05%2F06%2F11%2F56%2F24%2F0_missing_master1200.jpg

### ============================================================
### GetImage — rejected with 400 (url)
### ============================================================

### Missing url
GET {{baseUrl}}/images

### Other host
GET {{baseUrl}}/images?url=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com%2Fa.jpg

### http instead of https
GET {{baseUrl}}/images?url=http%3A%2F%2Fi.pximg.net%2Fa.jpg

### Non-default port
GET {{baseUrl}}/images?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.pximg.net%3A8080%2Fa.jpg

### Userinfo trick: the host is example.com, not i.pximg.net
GET {{baseUrl}}/images?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.pximg.net%40example.com%2Fa.jpg

### Host that only contains i.pximg.net
GET {{baseUrl}}/images?url=https%3A%2F%2Fevil-i.pximg.net.example.com%2Fa.jpg

### Not a URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/images?url=not-a-url
